{"obsah":"<p>A bikers' ball always gets wild, and because we know that, this year's first exhibition was ridden by the two chief wild ones, Martin Šimůnek and Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček. </p>\n\n<p>The journey to Sosnová was a bit of a lottery with freshly fallen snow, but the warm welcome on site and a hall packed to the brim fired the guys up for an almost 30-minute show for the motorbike survivors of last season. Martin complained about a sore back, but he still put on an incredible hosted show that hopefully pleased every lover of handlebars.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F01%2F324042827_898737094651075_7752835509155838684_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F01%2F324042827_898737094651075_7752835509155838684_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-230934\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F01%2F324043888_703302674710661_6415027825529160849_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F01%2F324043888_703302674710661_6415027825529160849_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-230933\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F01%2F325403819_1424711971265927_1209323879013322160_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F01%2F325403819_1424711971265927_120932387901